{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22036","headline":"有木诗八首 七 · 白居易","name":"有木诗八首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有木名凌霄，擢秀非孤标。\n偶依一株树，遂抽百尺条。\n托根附树身，开花寄树梢。\n自谓得其势，无因有动摇。\n一旦树摧倒，独立暂飘颻。\n疾风从东起，吹折不终朝。\n朝爲拂云花，暮爲委地樵。\n寄言立身者，勿学柔弱苗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22036.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22036","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}